clang on POWER: use the integrated assembler.

Makefile.power forces -fno-integrated-as for clang, which needs binutils gas.
The only thing llvm-mc rejects in the POWER8/9/10 kernels is the power9
gemm logic files invoking .macro names in a different case than defined
(gas matches macro names case-insensitively).

